claims:
12. A method of using a vacuum plate lifting system, the vacuum plate lifting system comprising:
a vacuum lifter apparatus for lifting sheet material articles;
at least one suction lifter proximate an edge of a suction plate, said suction lifter comprising a downwardly oriented suction cup, said cup being movably mounted in a substantially vertical direction relative to the suction plate and being connected to a source of air pressure for providing air suction to said cup for plucking upwards a local area of said of articles to be lifted;
an airflow suction system for conveying vacuum air pressure to a substantially planar perforated planar suction lifting surface;
a suction cup actuation system configured to actively drive said movement of the suction cup between a raised orientation in which the suction cup is raised relative to a level of said suction lifting surface and a lowered orientation in which the suction cup is substantially at or below the level of said suction lifting surface whereby, in use, said air suction is directed substantially downwardly towards a sheet material article to be lifted when said suction cup is in the lowered orientation; and
a control system for controlling the suction cup actuation system;
wherein the method comprises the steps of:
using the control system to control the movement of said suction cup by the suction cup actuation system to place said suction cup in the lowered orientation;
with the suction cup in the lowered orientation and with said suction lifting surface over said sheet material article to be lifted, applying said air suction to said suction cup to pluck upwards a local area of said of said article to be lifted;
using the control system to control the movement of said suction cup by the suction cup actuation system to place said suction cup in the raised orientation once the airflow suction system is being used or is about to be used to lift the remainder of said article to said suction lifting surface; and
with said local area being first being lifted by said suction cup, using the airflow suction system to convey vacuum air pressure to the suction lifting surface to lift the remainder of said article to said suction lifting surface.
